factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 7 problems
  reel_script says 'மேட்டுப்பாளையத்தில்' (in Mettupalayam) and the headline says 'மேட்டுப்பாளையத்தில்' as the location of the incident, but the article only gives Mettupalayam as the origin of Chinraj and the hospital location; the stabbing location (Sankar Nagar) is different — the place is misattributed.
  reel_script says Nijamudeen went to the grocery shop and 'முகமதுவிடம்' is said to be where the three people quarrelled, which is consistent, but the reel_script states the quarrel happened 'அங்கு முகமதுவிடம்' while the article says the quarrel was with Mohammed; the reel_script omits that Nijamudeen was attacked by all three (the article says the three kicked and beat him), and it does not mention the stabbing was done by Chinraj in the caption consistently.
  reel_script says 'தீபாவளி நாளில் ஏன் பிரச்னை செய்கிறீர்கள்' and calls the shop a 'மளிகைக் கடை' while the caption says 'மளிகை கடை அருகே' — the caption places the quarrel near the shop, a changed detail from the article which says Nijamudeen went to the shop and the quarrel was with Mohammed there.
  reel_script omits that Nijamudeen was beaten and kicked by the three men as an important fact in the attack sequence, only saying they 'அடித்து உதைத்தனர' — this is present, but the caption omits Chinraj's identity as one of the three men who beat him and the three-man attack sequence is simplified.
  The caption says 'மூவரால் தாக்கப்பட்டார்' and the slide says 'தகராறை சமாதானம் செய்த நிஜாமுதீன் ... தாக்கப்பட்டார்' which is fine, but the caption's 'சின்ராஜ் (42 வயது), பாக்கெட் கத்தியால்' sentence is ungrammatical: it reads as though Chinraj is an appositive to Nijamudeen and the knife clause is detached, making the sentence unclear.
  The caption's arrest sentence reads 'சின்ராஜ், சன்பீர் (33 வயது), ஆகிய இருவரையும்' — a misplaced comma and a dangling 'ஆகிய' that makes the sentence ungrammatical, and it omits Chinraj's age (42) that the article gives.
  The reel_script attributes 'வழக்குப் பதிவு செய்த போலீஸார்' correctly, but the slide 'யார் கைது?' lists Chinraj (42) and Sanpeer (33) and says they were arrested, which is fine; however the slide 'என்ன நடந்தது?' combines the quarrel location and the attack into one line, mixing two facts ('தகராறு' location with the stabbing) in a single sentence.
